  "findings": [
    "Entire original EN1341/KO1404 guides and EN250/KO246 15-question quizzes read before fixes. All6figures actually viewed.",
    "Current baseline Calico3.32.2 and Kubernetes-tested1.34–1.36; standard aggregated API/Kubernetes datastore prerequisites explicit. Examples use isolated demo namespace and are separate patterns, not production-tested manifest bundle.",
    "Corrected Kubernetes additive allow/endpoint-direction semantics, same-entry namespace+pod AND vs separate-entry OR, reply behavior, existing-connection/NAT limits, and existing named-port/endPort support.",
    "Fixed duplicate selector/destination YAML keys, numeric-port protocol omissions, server destination-v-source ports, namespace identity labels, global(expr) selector misuse, literal namespace/tenant interpolation, and broad cluster/system/host selection.",
    "Preserved valid Open Source3.32 tiers, staged policies and HTTP/Dikastes integration. HTTP requires configured ALP/CSI/Envoy/identity; no claim that genericEnvoy or HTTPfield alone activates it. CalicoALPguide1.28.1 recommendation not blindly upgraded or treated as all-version compatibility.",
    "Separated commercial Enterprise3.23 domain examples from OSS (expected OSS schema rejection), corrected DNSwildcard1+components/multiplelevels, trustedDNS/IPvsHTTPidentity limitations, duplicate destination maps and unsupported OSSdnsTrustedServers. policySyncPathPrefix isALPsync,notDNSenablement.",
    "Tier source constants default1e6/kube-admin1e3/kube-baseline1e7, selectedendpoint+direction/defaultActionDeny, Profilefallback and hoststageexceptions corrected. Removed earlyPass that bypassed later PCI/restricted-data policy; security/platformdefaultActionPass preserves checkingallguardrails.",
    "Calico tier.networkpolicies/tier.globalnetworkpolicies pseudo-resource plus synthetic tier.* and getTier RBAC preserved and correctly bound. Generic Kubernetes resourceNames isnotglob. Nativev3admissioncannotfilterGET/LIST/WATCH; authcan-i alone cannotverifycombinedtierchecks.",
    "NetworkSets use controlledlabels/scopes; fictionalcountry/maliciousIPrangesrelabelledasexamples. Overlapdenybeforeallow; tenantpoliciesuseexplicitvalueswithlabel/RBACownership. RFC1918notclusteronly.",
    "HostEndpoint creation separatedfromdefaultEndpointToHostAction/InstallationhostPorts. AutoHEPviaKubeControllersmergepatchpreservescontrollerchoices. FailsafeSSH22preventsclaimofbastion-onlypolicy; manualHEPexampleexplicitlyincompletefirewallwithmanagement/egressprereqs. Removedkubelet10255defaultopen.",
    "DoNotTrack/preDNAThostonly,applyOnForwardrequired,mutualexclusion,statelessrequest+responseports,andnoend-of-stage-defaultdrop corrected. PreDNATingressonly seesoriginaldestination; NodePortexampledoesnotclaimdirectPodLBcoverage.",
    "Currentcalicoctlhasnopolicy-trace; effectivepolicyrequiresalltiers,bothendpoints,labels,Service/NATpath. readinessnotlatencybenchmark; iptablesLogkernelvsFelixstdout; stagedpolicyavailableOSSwithWhiskerpolicies.pending. Removedunsourcedpolicy-countperformancebounds.",
    "All30originalquizanswersreviewed; ambiguousKOdefaultdenyoptionsandkube-proxy-irrelevantclaimfixed. Added4RBAC/portquestions;34answer-optionpairsaligned.6figures1retainedwithcaption5inaccurate/duplicatedrefsremoved;assetsunchanged."
  ],
